          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Widespread attacks and insurance/route disruptions to commercial shipping force individual allies to pursue unilateral emergency energy deals and maritime security measures, fragmenting agreement on sanctions, arms transfers and burden‑sharing for the Ukraine response." />
