          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Improved availability of resilient satellite communications enables authoritative, real‑time reporting and official messaging to reach affected populations and platforms despite terrestrial outages, crowding out rumor chains and lowering the speed/reach of misinformation." />
