          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained spikes in kinetic operations in Ukraine prompt reciprocal or diversionary actions by Russia and its partners (including naval harassment, strikes or cyberattacks) that bring Gulf actors and Western coalitions closer to nonlinear escalation thresholds." />
