          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp increases in battlefield kinetic activity create immediate national-security pressure on the U.S. and partners to broaden and more tightly enforce export controls on semiconductors, AI compute and related dual‑use technologies to prevent adversary acquisition." />
